### NV4 - Kịch bản kiểm thử API POST /api/reports (Dùng với VS Code REST Client hoặc IntelliJ)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}}/api/health

### 2. Gửi báo cáo ngập mới (Hợp lệ trong Đồng Nai)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="lat"

10.9447
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="lng"

106.8243
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="accuracyM"

15
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="capturedAt"

2026-11-08T10:00:00.000Z
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="deviceId"

device_manual_demo_01
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="source"

camera
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="note"

Ngập nặng ngã tư Amata, xe chết máy
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="flood_test.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./uploads/.gitkeep
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 3. Gửi báo cáo ngoài Đồng Nai (Hà Nội) -> 422 OUT_OF_AREA
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/reports
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="lat"

